# #327 bbt-mermaid test sweep

Oracle46f7fa1e; fresh base 658a39ffb71b211d17d5fd43290499f0eea4411b. Tests and cfg(test) only; overlap scan empty.
22 libtests plus the public doc example pass before and after: 23/0/0 ignored. No deletion/move, no sleeps present or removed, no wall-clock waits. All fixture bytes and include paths unchanged. Rendering setup is shared only for the immutable real-fixture geometry; each property still asserts its own behavior, and layout_is_deterministic still renders every source independently four times. The shared corpus has an explicit non-empty guard.
Reported binary times total 0.14 s before / 0.07 s after; no speed threshold or halving claim below coarse reporting resolution. Strict Clippy and affected invariants are combined author validation.

